WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:13.055
&lt;i&gt;And you don't even notice&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;the box that you're in,&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:13.138 --> 00:00:15.807
&lt;i&gt;until someone comes along&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;and lets you out.&lt;/i&gt;

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:31.740
-Can I help you?
-Hey.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.204
Thanks.

00:00:47.798 --> 00:00:49.216
-Where's Luther?
-Who cares?

00:00:49.299 --> 00:00:51.009
Probably out for a run.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.221
Love the haircut.

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:00.477
So, I… I talked
to Marcus last night.

00:01:00.561 --> 00:01:03.021
Wait, what? You talked
with the enemy by yourself?

00:01:03.105 --> 00:01:04.565
Yeah, well, somebody
had to do something.

00:01:04.648 --> 00:01:06.191
Who elected you, Vanya?

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.319
It's Viktor.

00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:11.697
Who's Viktor?

00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:17.828
I am.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:19.413
It's who I've always been.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:29.089
Is that an issue for anyone?

00:01:29.173 --> 00:01:30.757
Nah, I'm good with it.

00:01:30.841 --> 00:01:31.842
Yeah, me too.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:32.885
Cool.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:35.554
Truly happy for you, Viktor.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:42.895
You know,
I always hated mirrors.

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:46.565
Thought everybody felt
so strange in their skin.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:52.154
I guess,
that's not true, right?

00:01:55.616 --> 00:01:56.617
What do you see now?

00:02:05.083 --> 00:02:06.084
Me.

00:02:10.297 --> 00:02:11.298
Just me.

00:02:17.679 --> 00:02:19.556
Thank you
for trusting me with this.

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:22.518
You're family, Viktor.

00:02:23.477 --> 00:02:24.520
Okay?

00:02:25.062 --> 00:02:26.355
And there's nothing…

00:02:27.314 --> 00:02:29.608
nothing that would
make me love you less.

00:02:38.617 --> 00:02:39.826
Hey. What's up?

00:02:40.953 --> 00:02:42.496
Luther wants to throw you
a big stupid party

00:02:42.579 --> 00:02:43.830
so you can feel loved.

00:02:46.834 --> 00:02:48.836
-Oh.
-Do you feel loved?

00:02:50.879 --> 00:02:52.297
Yeah, I… I do.

00:02:52.381 --> 00:02:53.882
Good. You are.

00:02:54.842 --> 00:02:56.885
Can we all get back
to saving the world now?

00:03:00.973 --> 00:03:01.890
I…

00:03:05.686 --> 00:03:06.895
I really like the hair.

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:10.065
It's a number ten?

00:03:10.858 --> 00:03:12.109
Yeah, that's a good choice.

00:03:12.818 --> 00:03:15.070
Really… frames your face.

00:03:17.489 --> 00:03:18.740
Thanks.

00:03:19.366 --> 00:03:20.492
I'll see you later.

